<h1 data-frwd-id="a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003">Minimal FRWD</h1>
<p data-frwd-id="a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004">The smallest document that still exercises every structural rule in FRWD 0.1.</p>
</header>
<section data-frwd-id="a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005">
<h2 data-frwd-id="a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006">What this file proves</h2>
<p data-frwd-id="a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007">A conforming document is ordinary semantic HTML. Nothing here needs FRWD software to be readable, and nothing here executes.</p>
<ul data-frwd-id="a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008">
<li data-frwd-id="a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009">Every editable block object carries a stable identifier.</li>
<li data-frwd-id="a1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a">The manifest, the stylesheet and the content all live in one file.</li>
<li data-frwd-id="a1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b">Opening and saving it changes nothing at all.</li>
</ul>
</section>
<figure data-frwd-id="a1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c">
<blockquote data-frwd-id="a1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000d">
<p data-frwd-id="a1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000e">Semantic HTML is the canonical document.</p>
</blockquote>
<figcaption data-frwd-id="a1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000f">Invariant 1, from the FRWD design pack.</figcaption>
</figure>
</article>
